{"fps": 30, "frames": 1707, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 158, "text": "In nineteen seventy-two, Wall Street found fifty stocks you'd never have to sell.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 0, "e": 5}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 7, "e": 16}, {"w": "seventy-two,", "f": 18, "e": 48}, {"w": "Wall", "f": 50, "e": 55}, {"w": "Street", "f": 57, "e": 64}, {"w": "found", "f": 66, "e": 75}, {"w": "fifty", "f": 77, "e": 85}, {"w": "stocks", "f": 87, "e": 98}, {"w": "you'd", "f": 101, "e": 107}, {"w": "never", "f": 110, "e": 117}, {"w": "have", "f": 119, "e": 123}, {"w": "to", "f": 126, "e": 128}, {"w": "sell.", "f": 133, "e": 153}]}, {"a": 158, "b": 307, "text": "Imagine you're a young bank trust officer, and old Mister Pembroke slides you the list.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 160, "e": 167}, {"w": "you're", "f": 168, "e": 171}, {"w": "a", "f": 174, "e": 176}, {"w": "young", "f": 181, "e": 185}, {"w": "bank", "f": 189, "e": 192}, {"w": "trust", "f": 194, "e": 203}, {"w": "officer,", "f": 206, "e": 224}, {"w": "and", "f": 226, "e": 229}, {"w": "old", "f": 232, "e": 235}, {"w": "Mister", "f": 237, "e": 242}, {"w": "Pembroke", "f": 247, "e": 261}, {"w": "slides", "f": 263, "e": 274}, {"w": "you", "f": 275, "e": 277}, {"w": "the", "f": 278, "e": 279}, {"w": "list.", "f": 281, "e": 301}]}, {"a": 307, "b": 480, "text": "The Nifty Fifty. One-decision stocks: buy once, never think again.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 309, "e": 311}, {"w": "Nifty", "f": 315, "e": 327}, {"w": "Fifty.", "f": 331, "e": 345}, {"w": "One-decision", "f": 361, "e": 379}, {"w": "stocks:", "f": 382, "e": 407}, {"w": "buy", "f": 410, "e": 414}, {"w": "once,", "f": 416, "e": 434}, {"w": "never", "f": 439, "e": 443}, {"w": "think", "f": 446, "e": 450}, {"w": "again.", "f": 453, "e": 473}]}, {"a": 480, "b": 627, "text": "Polaroid costs ninety-five times earnings. Pembroke doesn't blink.", "words": [{"w": "Polaroid", "f": 482, "e": 498}, {"w": "costs", "f": 501, "e": 514}, {"w": "ninety-five", "f": 517, "e": 533}, {"w": "times", "f": 535, "e": 544}, {"w": "earnings.", "f": 546, "e": 567}, {"w": "Pembroke", "f": 574, "e": 587}, {"w": "doesn't", "f": 590, "e": 597}, {"w": "blink.", "f": 599, "e": 624}]}, {"a": 627, "b": 709, "text": "Then the market falls almost in half.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 629, "e": 633}, {"w": "the", "f": 640, "e": 642}, {"w": "market", "f": 645, "e": 654}, {"w": "falls", "f": 656, "e": 665}, {"w": "almost", "f": 667, "e": 677}, {"w": "in", "f": 679, "e": 683}, {"w": "half.", "f": 686, "e": 704}]}, {"a": 709, "b": 836, "text": "Avon drops eighty-six percent. Polaroid drops ninety.", "words": [{"w": "Avon", "f": 711, "e": 722}, {"w": "drops", "f": 725, "e": 736}, {"w": "eighty-six", "f": 738, "e": 752}, {"w": "percent.", "f": 754, "e": 777}, {"w": "Polaroid", "f": 778, "e": 793}, {"w": "drops", "f": 795, "e": 805}, {"w": "ninety.", "f": 809, "e": 834}]}, {"a": 836, "b": 908, "text": "So were the experts just fools?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 838, "e": 841}, {"w": "were", "f": 848, "e": 850}, {"w": "the", "f": 853, "e": 854}, {"w": "experts", "f": 855, "e": 866}, {"w": "just", "f": 869, "e": 875}, {"w": "fools?", "f": 878, "e": 891}]}, {"a": 908, "b": 1047, "text": "Later, a professor tested it: the whole list, bought at the very top.", "words": [{"w": "Later,", "f": 910, "e": 923}, {"w": "a", "f": 925, "e": 926}, {"w": "professor", "f": 928, "e": 942}, {"w": "tested", "f": 944, "e": 953}, {"w": "it:", "f": 955, "e": 967}, {"w": "the", "f": 969, "e": 971}, {"w": "whole", "f": 974, "e": 981}, {"w": "list,", "f": 983, "e": 997}, {"w": "bought", "f": 999, "e": 1006}, {"w": "at", "f": 1008, "e": 1010}, {"w": "the", "f": 1011, "e": 1013}, {"w": "very", "f": 1017, "e": 1024}, {"w": "top.", "f": 1026, "e": 1038}]}, {"a": 1047, "b": 1150, "text": "Twenty-six years on, it had nearly matched the market.", "words": [{"w": "Twenty-six", "f": 1049, "e": 1065}, {"w": "years", "f": 1069, "e": 1072}, {"w": "on,", "f": 1074, "e": 1088}, {"w": "it", "f": 1089, "e": 1090}, {"w": "had", "f": 1094, "e": 1097}, {"w": "nearly", "f": 1099, "e": 1109}, {"w": "matched", "f": 1113, "e": 1122}, {"w": "the", "f": 1123, "e": 1125}, {"w": "market.", "f": 1127, "e": 1138}]}, {"a": 1150, "b": 1312, "text": "You see, it's like dinner at a great restaurant. Perfect food can't save a crazy bill.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1152, "e": 1154}, {"w": "see,", "f": 1157, "e": 1168}, {"w": "it's", "f": 1170, "e": 1173}, {"w": "like", "f": 1175, "e": 1179}, {"w": "dinner", "f": 1182, "e": 1189}, {"w": "at", "f": 1190, "e": 1191}, {"w": "a", "f": 1193, "e": 1194}, {"w": "great", "f": 1195, "e": 1202}, {"w": "restaurant.", "f": 1205, "e": 1224}, {"w": "Perfect", "f": 1230, "e": 1241}, {"w": "food", "f": 1246, "e": 1255}, {"w": "can't", "f": 1257, "e": 1264}, {"w": "save", "f": 1266, "e": 1273}, {"w": "a", "f": 1275, "e": 1278}, {"w": "crazy", "f": 1280, "e": 1289}, {"w": "bill.", "f": 1291, "e": 1307}]}, {"a": 1312, "b": 1436, "text": "Polaroid was priced about eight times higher than its future could pay.", "words": [{"w": "Polaroid", "f": 1314, "e": 1330}, {"w": "was", "f": 1333, "e": 1335}, {"w": "priced", "f": 1337, "e": 1344}, {"w": "about", "f": 1346, "e": 1355}, {"w": "eight", "f": 1358, "e": 1360}, {"w": "times", "f": 1362, "e": 1371}, {"w": "higher", "f": 1376, "e": 1383}, {"w": "than", "f": 1385, "e": 1387}, {"w": "its", "f": 1390, "e": 1394}, {"w": "future", "f": 1397, "e": 1403}, {"w": "could", "f": 1406, "e": 1410}, {"w": "pay.", "f": 1415, "e": 1433}]}, {"a": 1436, "b": 1528, "text": "Philip Morris looked pricey at twenty-four times earnings.", "words": [{"w": "Philip", "f": 1438, "e": 1442}, {"w": "Morris", "f": 1445, "e": 1456}, {"w": "looked", "f": 1458, "e": 1463}, {"w": "pricey", "f": 1465, "e": 1477}, {"w": "at", "f": 1479, "e": 1481}, {"w": "twenty-four", "f": 1485, "e": 1497}, {"w": "times", "f": 1499, "e": 1506}, {"w": "earnings.", "f": 1509, "e": 1529}]}, {"a": 1528, "b": 1582, "text": "It was worth sixty-eight.", "words": [{"w": "It", "f": 1530, "e": 1531}, {"w": "was", "f": 1534, "e": 1538}, {"w": "worth", "f": 1543, "e": 1547}, {"w": "sixty-eight.", "f": 1552, "e": 1582}]}, {"a": 1582, "b": 1707, "text": "The one decision was never the stock. It was the price.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1584, "e": 1586}, {"w": "one", "f": 1589, "e": 1591}, {"w": "decision", "f": 1593, "e": 1609}, {"w": "was", "f": 1611, "e": 1614}, {"w": "never", "f": 1618, "e": 1625}, {"w": "the", "f": 1626, "e": 1627}, {"w": "stock.", "f": 1630, "e": 1653}, {"w": "It", "f": 1655, "e": 1657}, {"w": "was", "f": 1659, "e": 1662}, {"w": "the", "f": 1664, "e": 1666}, {"w": "price.", "f": 1669, "e": 1687}]}]}